.Dd November 1, 2026
.Dt OV3640S 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ov3640s
.Nd OV3640 sensor power sequencing and identification
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd "ov3640s* at iic? addr 0x3c"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver controls an OmniVision OV3640 sensor connected over I2C/SCCB.
It enables the shared sensor supply, sequences the reset and power-down GPIOs,
and reads the sensor identifier over SCCB.
The driver reports the identifier during attachment and leaves the sensor in
reset and power-down after probing.
.Pp
The device-tree node uses the compatible string
.Dq ovti,ov3640
and supplies
.Va reg , reset-gpios , powerdown-gpios , power-supply , clocks
and
.Va clock-names
properties.
The clock describes the module's fixed 24 MHz oscillator.
The shared 3.3 V rail is never disabled by this driver.
.Pp
The OV3640 module in the left camera slot is supported by the
.Pa ESP_MOSAICO_CAMERA
configuration.
The camera node is disabled in the base
.Pa ESP_MOSAICO
device tree.
.Sh LIMITATIONS
This driver only identifies the OV3640 sensor.
It does not configure image formats, attach a video device, or capture frames.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr iic 4
